    "en": {
      "trackName": "Beauty Puzzle Slider",
      "description": "Apple Watch Exclusive 'Beauty Puzzle Slider'\n\nGame Overview\nThis is a game where you use the small screen of the Apple Watch to slide tiles that have been cut from a photo and try to restore the original image.\n\nHow to Get Started\nInside the Apple Watch app, select or take a photo of your choice.\nThe photo is divided into nine pieces, and one tile is randomly removed. Slide the remaining tiles to fit them into the shape of the original photo.\nThree modes are available: EASY, Normal, and Hard, making it a challenging game depending on the difficulty level.\n\nControls\nTouch Control: You can slide the tiles with your finger.\nSlide the tiles adjacent to the empty space to complete the photo.\n\nFeatures\nCustom Photos: You can incorporate photos stored on your Apple Watch or those taken directly with the camera into the game.\n\"Puzzle Slider\" is the perfect game for waiting or taking a short break.\nUse your own photos to experience the fun of a unique sliding puzzle.\nGameplay on the small screen of the Apple Watch is refreshing, and you'll definitely want to challenge it again and again!\"",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/beauty-puzzle-slider/id6463190876?uo=4",
